/**
 * tests/adversarial-m2-journeys.js
 * Empirical Adversarial Test Harness: Deep Details <-> Player Navigation Journeys
 * 
 * Specifically challenges:
 * 1. details -> player -> exitPlayer -> details -> Back
 * 2. movies -> details -> player -> exitPlayer -> details -> Back
 * 3. series -> details -> related details -> player -> exitPlayer -> Back -> Back
 * 4. search -> details -> player -> exitPlayer -> details -> Back
 * 5. TV Remote KeyCode 461 / Escape key simulation
 * 6. Multiple sequential playback sessions
 * 7. Deep related details daisy-chains
 * 8. Deep-link bootstraps (#player, #details)
 * 9. Header nav interruption and origin reset
